      "kind": "product",
      "identityStatus": "needs_confirmation",
      "categoryID": 4,
      "benefits": "Demonstrated biological effect: sustained increases in growth hormone and IGF-1 concentrations in short randomized studies of healthy adults. These are hormone measurements, not proof of better recovery, muscle gain, fat loss, sleep, or longevity. The studied material was the long-acting DAC form, with the exact salt incompletely specified. Clinical benefit for growth hormone deficiency and long-term wellness use was not established by those studies."
    }
